victorious majesty:                    

  Kwoth (#3), 14g taxbase, 37g in treasury
  Hokuto (#4), 37g taxbase, 22g in treasury is of Divine alignment.
  Prometeo (#5)
  Kahn (#6), 25g taxbase, 23g in treasury
  Giovanna d'Arco (#7)
  Circe (#8), 45g taxbase, 5g in treasury


  My lord, the following Kings are cautiously neutral with thy ever-
victorious majesty:                    

  Bradipo I (#2)


